cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this recipe, please cite it and credit the upstream components listed in CREDITS.md."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
title: "DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 abliterated EXL3 3.84 bpw on three DGX Spark systems with TensorFold TP3"
version: v1.2
date-released: 2026-11-04
authors:
  - name: ChimeraWerks
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChimeraWerks/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-3x-DGX-Spark-TP3-TensorFold-abliterated"
url: "https://github.com/ChimeraWerks/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-3x-DGX-Spark-TP3-TensorFold-abliterated"
abstract: >-
  Production deployment recipe for DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 abliterated,
  EXL3 3.84 bits per weight excluding the output head, on three NVIDIA
  DGX Spark GB10 systems using TensorFold tensor parallelism 3.
  Includes operating instructions, component provenance and
  dated serving measurements. The v1.2 engine is 678ea1b with serving API
  0.1.5, 8M KV, C16 and top_k 20. No model checkpoint is distributed.
keywords:
  - DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017
  - DGX Spark
  - GB10
  - EXL3
  - abliterated
  - tensor parallelism
  - TP3
  - TensorFold
references:
  - type: software
    title: "TensorFold"
    authors:
      - name: "TensorFold contributors"
    url: "https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold"
  - type: dataset
    title: "DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 base model"
    authors:
      - name: "DeepSeek"
    url: "https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017"
